OL,3,GNEWSALondon Underground hit by driver
OL,4,Astrike but more trains running than
OL,5,Aexpected
OL,6,
OL,7,FServices are running better than
OL,8,Fexpected because more drivers than
OL,9,Fexpected have turned up for work, TfL
OL,10,Fsays
OL,12,FThe disagreement centres around the
OL,13,Fproposed voluntary introduction of a
OL,14,Ffour-day working week with condensed
OL,15,Fhours. Read more about why drivers are
OL,16,Fstriking
OL,18,FFurther strike action is planned in
OL,19,FDecember, January and February
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
